OL,3,GNEWSASewing shop owners retire after 54
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the year 1958 - Harold Macmillan
OL,7,Fis prime minister, Bolton Wanderers win
OL,8,Fthe FA Cup and the UK's first motorway
OL,9,F- the Preston bypass - opens.
OL,11,FIt is also the year that a small family
OL,12,Fbusiness put down its roots in
OL,13,FWolverhampton.
OL,15,FBrewers Sewing Machines Limited on
OL,16,FDudley Road began in an era when
OL,17,Fface-to-face service was critical.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
