OL,3,GNEWSASewing shop owners retire after 54
OL,4,Ayears
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, in 2026, when sewing machines have
OL,7,Fbuilt-in computers and many sales are
OL,8,Fdone online, its owners Alan and
OL,9,FKathleen Harvey - who took over from
OL,10,FKathleen's father in the 70s - are
OL,11,Fstepping down.
